  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Jenny** (1 other source): The taper's right microphone failed during the first chorus of this song [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Going to Jamaica**: back after 44 archived shows (1212 days) [3]\n- **Horseradish Road**: back after 43 archived shows (1000 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2005-07-04.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 14 songs; 44 min; rated 3/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Recording gets quieter around the midpoint, requiring higher playback volume and sounding less clear than earlier, though still good [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Crossing Over [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2005-07-04.flac16**: taped by Thomas Hartnett; transferred by Thomas Hartnett; source: AUD>Visivox SCM Broadcast Pro microphones>Visivox SCM preamp>Sharp MD-MT866 [1]. Also: Taper copied the left channel to the right after the mic failure, making the rest mono; volume boosted in Sound Forge [1]",
